ng=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🤩 </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Superstition</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> - more than mead!<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>West Coast IPA </span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>with Cascade, Chinook &amp; Mosaic<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Imperial Cider</span></span></span></span></strong></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/d9dd8209-0479-bd63-438c-b0808def5d52.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>🐻 Beary much worth trying<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Woody’s Blanc de Blanc </span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>Non-Alcoholic sparkling wine</span></span></span></span></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<div class=\"reader-image-row reader-brew-grid\" data-columns=\"2\"><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/2d1cfcb8-fc84-857a-9ea4-bdb21a7696b9.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><span>❄️ Winter is coming<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>1911 Cranberry</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Gose<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Brooklyn Winter IPA</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> with Simcoe &amp; Trident<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Downeast Winter Blend</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> Cider<br>• </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>Harpoon Winter Warmer</span></span></span></span></strong></p></figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/993a9788-4683-b02a-e850-4c6d3d14138e.jpeg\" width=\"298\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><figcaption><p><span><span><span><img src=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f381/32.png\" alt=\"🎁\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Hardywood</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> home at last<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Gingerbread Stout </span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>Imperial Milk Stout with Cinnamon, Vanilla, Ginger &amp; Honey<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Bourbon Barrel Gingerbread Stout</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Barrel Aged Milk Stout with Cinnamon, Vanilla, Ginger &amp; Honey<br>• </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Kentucky Christmas Morning</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> Barrel Aged Gingerbread Stout with coffee<br>•</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Holiday Gift Pack</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> with</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Gingerbread Stout, Christmas Morning, Fluffy GBS</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span> &amp;</span></span></span><strong><span><span><span> Chocolate Peppermint Stout</span></span></span></strong></p></figcaption></figure></div>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/b9a684df-4a4d-bfd0-b15b-c54ec7a5a5bc.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><strong><span><span><span>Vite Colte Brachetto d'Acqui</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>: </span></span></span><span><span><span><span>A gorgeous sweet red from our Italian favorite Vite Colte. Velvety smooth with a slight effervescence, we love the play between strawberry, cherry and rose. Perfect to pair salty snacks, blue cheese or a complimentary sweet treat.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>Helenental Gruner Veltliner: </span></strong><span><span><span><span>A 1 Liter of Gruner Veltliner is at the top of my favorite things list - easy to open, generous in quantity and affordable enough to drink on a random Tuesday. Fermented entirely in stainless steel to preserve every ounce of freshness, enjoy crisp apples, pears and lime paired with that signature white pepper spice on the finish. Sustainable &amp; Vegan.</span></span></span></span></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/41131891-2c6c-e813-da6e-abf334e8e5e3.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p><span><span><span>Being the newest member of the ‘Brew Crew’ and having a profound love of California Reds, it feels a bit poetic that my first write up be about none other than a BIG CALI RED!!<br><br>Fall is in the air, or at least, it’s on the calendar! Your sweaters may still be waiting patiently in the closet but there’s no reason you can’t start sipping into the season. Meet </span></span></span><strong><span><span><span>Slingshot North Coast Cabernet Sauvignon</span></span></span></strong><span><span><span>, a California red that brings a little autumn magic to these lingering summer days. She has a bold personality, and a target inspired label- ready to hit a bullseye between summer sunshine and fall comfort!<br><br>Full bodied with noticeable tannins and a dry finish while also being jammy with the classic notes of dark berries and ripe cherry you would expect from a Cali Cab, plus an unexpected savory note of fresh celery. Pair this with a late season barbeque juicy burger, or bring out the roasted vegetables, hearty pasta, and comfort classics. This wine is ready to make the transition with you!<br><br>Getting to expand my already vast wine knowledge has been a bonus of the job, and wines like this make it even better!</span></span></span></p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span>This week’s writeup is brought to you by Bre</span></span></span></span></em></p>\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/44528625-75ce-77b6-246b-4628384a151b.jpeg\" width=\"612\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<img src=\"https://mcusercontent.com/be20bbfba341582993786f7f0/images/8b6d31ef-302d-1938-796b-fb770122884e.png\" width=\"520\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n<p>Details to follow…</p>\n<p>Thanks for your business! See you soon, Beth, Julie &amp; Aidan and the entire Brew Crew</p>",
